OnboardingRequest.description:
The onboarding submission — Q1 (profession) and Q2 (needs).

The name is derived from the email server-side, so it is not submitted;
nothing else is generated at onboarding, so nothing else is collected.

WorkflowWithIntegrations.description:
Read-time view of a workflow: the persisted `Workflow` plus its computed
integration requirements. Never persisted — the storage model is `Workflow`;
these fields are populated by the service on read paths only.

put.description:
Bulk update multiple todos with the same changes.

Example:
```json
{
    "todo_ids": ["id1", "id2", "id3"],
    "updates": {
        "completed": true,
        "priority": "high"
    }
}
```
